{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "note-plan-graph",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -600,
      "y": -380,
      "width": 1200,
      "height": 260,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "# Layered Plan Graph\n\nRows are the authoritative LT → MT → ST → WP decomposition levels. Solid arrows decompose; labeled dashed arrows are typed cross-cutting relationships. Open a linked node for decisions and evidence; use `structure/graph.json` for programmatic traversal."
    },
    {
      "id": "plan-LT-001",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -210,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 240,
      "color": "3",
      "text": "## [[_aiHumanInteract/plan/long-term/LT-001.md|LT-001 · 交付低摩擦、可追溯的科学光谱协同工作台]]\n\n**Level:** `long-term` · **Status:** `in_progress`\n**Updated:** 2026-11-24\n\n让科研人员通过直接画布交互与可回溯知识债机制高效完成光谱特征探索。\n\n**Qualities:** 像拨动实体仪器一样直接连贯，不退化为管理弹窗"
    },
    {
      "id": "plan-MT-001",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -470,
      "y": 420,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 240,
      "color": "3",
      "text": "## [[_aiHumanInteract/plan/mid-term/MT-001.md|MT-001 · 建立直接画布交互与认知分拣闸门]]\n\n**Level:** `mid-term` · **Status:** `in_progress`\n**Updated:** 2026-11-24\n\n实现无模态打断的谱峰选择画布与三态技术声明分拣模块。"
    },
    {
      "id": "plan-MT-002",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 420,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 240,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "## [[_aiHumanInteract/plan/mid-term/MT-002.md|MT-002 · 实现跨会话谱峰持久存储与可选审计回放]]\n\n**Level:** `mid-term` · **Status:** `proposed`\n**Updated:** 2026-11-24\n\n保证谱峰 ID 在会话切换与压缩恢复后稳定可寻址。"
    },
    {
      "id": "plan-ST-001",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -470,
      "y": 840,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 240,
      "color": "3",
      "text": "## [[_aiHumanInteract/plan/short-term/ST-001.md|ST-001 · 落地直接操作画布与三态技术分拣核心]]\n\n**Level:** `short-term` · **Status:** `in_progress`\n**Updated:** 2026-11-24\n\n完成画布组件与三态分拣受控方案比选落地。"
    },
    {
      "id": "plan-ST-002",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 840,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 240,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "## [[_aiHumanInteract/plan/short-term/ST-002.md|ST-002 · 构建谱峰存储与审计扩展点]]\n\n**Level:** `short-term` · **Status:** `ready`\n**Updated:** 2026-11-24\n\n先交付可逆键值谱峰存储，并将事件回放模块保持在待重审边界后。"
    },
    {
      "id": "plan-WP-001",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1510,
      "y": 1260,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 240,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "## [[_aiHumanInteract/plan/work-package/WP-001.md|WP-001 · 实现光谱谱峰直接选中画布与工作台会话入口]]\n\n**Level:** `work-package` · **Status:** `done`\n**Updated:** 2026-11-24\n\n提供零模态弹窗阻塞的谱峰直接选中句柄与后端会话编排入口。"
    },
    {
      "id": "plan-WP-002",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -990,
      "y": 1260,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 240,
      "color": "3",
      "text": "## [[_aiHumanInteract/plan/work-package/WP-002.md|WP-002 · 采用显式三态技术分拣闸门连接知识债书签]]\n\n**Level:** `work-package` · **Status:** `in_progress`\n**Updated:** 2026-11-24\n\n在不强迫非完全技术能力责任人盲目点 Agree 的前提下维护技术知情权。"
    },
    {
      "id": "plan-WP-003",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -470,
      "y": 1260,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 240,
      "color": "#777777",
      "text": "## [[_aiHumanInteract/plan/work-package/WP-003.md|WP-003 · 备选方案：基于启发式风险分静默跳过技术声明]]\n\n**Level:** `work-package` · **Status:** `superseded`\n**Updated:** 2026-11-24\n\n在不强迫非完全技术能力责任人盲目点 Agree 的前提下维护技术知情权。\n\n**Alternative of:** `WP-002`"
    },
    {
      "id": "plan-WP-004",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 1260,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 240,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "## [[_aiHumanInteract/plan/work-package/WP-004.md|WP-004 · 落地轻量键值谱峰特征持久存储]]\n\n**Level:** `work-package` · **Status:** `done`\n**Updated:** 2026-11-24\n\n用最小可逆结构持久化 `PK-###` 波长与备注信息。"
    },
    {
      "id": "plan-WP-005",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 570,
      "y": 1260,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 240,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "## [[_aiHumanInteract/plan/work-package/WP-005.md|WP-005 · 构建追加式事件溯源回放审计器（受 KD-002 书签约束）]]\n\n**Level:** `work-package` · **Status:** `proposed`\n**Updated:** 2026-11-24\n\n在确有跨版本严格回放需求时提供谱峰变更事件日志重放。"
    },
    {
      "id": "plan-WP-006",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1090,
      "y": 1260,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 240,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "## [[_aiHumanInteract/plan/work-package/WP-006.md|WP-006 · 端到端验证直接画布会话与三态分拣契约]]\n\n**Level:** `work-package` · **Status:** `done`\n**Updated:** 2026-11-24\n\n通过自动化回归用例验证直接谱峰标记与知识债书签触发行为。"
    }
  ],
